{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Trailer Incident</strong> is an atmospheric first-person horror set in 1980s America.<br>You find yourself inside a small <strong>RV</strong> hidden deep within the woods. It\u2019s quiet \u2014 only the wind, the rain, and the soft crackle of an old TV.<br>But when strange lights appear in the sky, the silence turns into unease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The night grows longer, the radio picks up strange signals, objects move on their own, and someone \u2014 or something \u2014 is walking outside.<br>No weapons. No contact with the outside world. Only the beam of your flashlight and your nerves.<br>Explore the RV and its surroundings, search for answers, and ask the right questions \u2014 just to make it through the night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 A tense atmosphere of isolation, fear, and the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117440/extras/f08c8ae552d05b926648ecc4327d8eb1.poster.avif?t=1762692548\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117440/extras/f08c8ae552d05b926648ecc4327d8eb1.webm?t=1762692548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117440/extras/f08c8ae552d05b926648ecc4327d8eb1.mp4?t=1762692548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f Explore and interact within a confined space: the RV, the forest, and everything around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>\u2615 Sleep and wake mechanics \u2014 find coffee, brew it, and stay awake before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117440/extras/2b11333b367c714e51a0d9925c9c99a9.poster.avif?t=1762692548\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117440/extras/2b11333b367c714e51a0d9925c9c99a9.webm?t=1762692548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117440/extras/2b11333b367c714e51a0d9925c9c99a9.mp4?t=1762692548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udcfb Audio interactivity \u2014 radio noises, signals, and voices that guide you toward the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>\ud83d\udef8 A unique setting and a tribute to classic horror of the 80s\u201390s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117440/extras/828b5daece83eab9d241775c62470ac5.poster.avif?t=1762692548\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117440/extras/828b5daece83eab9d241775c62470ac5.webm?t=1762692548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117440/extras/828b5daece83eab9d241775c62470ac5.mp4?t=1762692548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\ud83c\udfae Attention to detail and high-quality execution that enhance immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117440/extras/64115a5c3b638c236da8b61623d7e628.poster.avif?t=1762692548\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117440/extras/64115a5c3b638c236da8b61623d7e628.webm?t=1762692548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste